      "category": "Table",
      "text": "<table><thead><tr><th>STATUS OF BILL</th><th>PERIOD OF TIME AFTER TRANSMITTAL OF BILL TO CITY AGENCY WITHIN WHICH REPORT THEREON IS DUE IN ALBANY</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>In Committee</td><td>5 days</td></tr><tr><td>Advancing on Calendar</td><td>2 days</td></tr><tr><td>\"10 day\" bill (passed by both Houses and sent to the Governor before adjournment of the Legislature)</td><td>2 days</td></tr><tr><td>\"30 day\" bill (sent to Governor after adjournment of the Legislature)</td><td>5 days</td></tr></tbody></table>",
